  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Core state",
      "items": [
        "users carries role/user_type, is_active · is_blocked · is_verified, retry_count, the pepper-hashed password and the google_id/github_id columns the social flows link by",
        "sessions hold the opaque refresh token (unique) with ip/ua and an absolute expires_at; audit_logs records admin actions via a narrow Audit port"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Outbox",
      "items": [
        "each slice's queries.sql compiles through sqlc against migrations/ into committed internal/gen/db — adapters in postgres.go are its only consumers",
        "email_jobs INSERT rides the same pgx transaction as the state change; the claim CTE needs the partial index on (status, scheduled_at) WHERE status = 'queued'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Delivery + ledgers",
      "items": [
        "failures back off 2^n minutes ±20% jitter and dead-letter to failed at max_retries 3",
        "the janitor (<APP>_JANITOR_POLL 1h) purges expired sessions and code rows with idempotent DELETEs — replica-safe, audit rows untouched"
      ]
    }
  ]
}